These tables are included so reviewers can reproduce the NCEAS analyses.
Redistribution must keep attribution and the **non-commercial** restriction.
Do not relicense them as MIT, Apache-2.0, or any licence that permits
commercial use.

Author-generated summaries that do **not** copy occurrence coordinates
(`results/`, `SI/tables/`) are released with the software (MIT), without
removing the CC BY-NC terms that still apply to the underlying NCEAS tables.
